    <text:index-body>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_1" loext:marker-style-name="T6"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc112848936" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">1.<text:span text:style-name="T6"> </text:span>Introduction des vidéos de diaporama<text:span text:style-name="T7"> 4</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T8"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc112848937" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">1.1.<text:span text:style-name="T8"> </text:span>What are slideshow videos?<text:span text:style-name="T7"> 4</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T8"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc112848938" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">1.2.<text:span text:style-name="T8"> </text:span>What resources do I need to create a slideshow video?<text:span text:style-name="T7"> 5</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T8"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc112848939" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link"><text:soft-page-break/>1.3.<text:span text:style-name="T8"> </text:span>What slideshow templates are currently available?<text:span text:style-name="T7"> 5</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_1" loext:marker-style-name="T6"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc112848940" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">2.<text:span text:style-name="T6"> </text:span>Configuration des vidéos de diaporama<text:span text:style-name="T7"> 6</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T8"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc112848941" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">2.1.<text:span text:style-name="T8"> </text:span>Téléchargement des modèles vidéo de diaporama<text:span text:style-name="T7"> 6</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T8"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc112848942" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">2.2.<text:span text:style-name="T8"> </text:span>Installation de LibreOffice<text:span text:style-name="T7"> 7</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_1" loext:marker-style-name="T6"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc112848943" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">3.<text:span text:style-name="T6"> </text:span>Preparing an app project for slideshow videos<text:span text:style-name="T7"> 7</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_1" loext:marker-style-name="T6"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc112848944" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.<text:span text:style-name="T6"> </text:span>Exécuter l&apos;assistant de création de diaporama<text:span text:style-name="T7"> 8</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_1" loext:marker-style-name="T6"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc112848945" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link"><text:soft-page-break/>5.<text:span text:style-name="T6"> </text:span>Distribuer et utiliser les vidéos<text:span text:style-name="T7"> 10</text:span></text:a></text:p>
    </text:index-body>
   </text:table-of-content>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum17">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:h text:style-name="P22" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc112848936"/>Présentation des vidéos du diaporama<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc112848936"/> </text:h>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P18" loext:marker-style-name="T9"/>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum17">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:list>
      <text:list-item>
       <text:h text:style-name="P26" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc112848937"/>Que sont les vidéos du diaporama ?<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc112848937"/></text:h>
      </text:list-item>
     </text:list>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">Les vidéos diaporamas sont des vidéos créées à l’aide d’un ensemble d’images fixes ainsi que de fichiers audio provenant d’un projet <text:span text:style-name="T10">Scripture App Builder</text:span>. Pendant la lecture de l&apos;audio, les images vont faire un panoramique et/ou zoomer. Les sous-titres seront générés à partir du texte de l&apos;application.<text:line-break/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Picture 5" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="5.5374in" svg:height="3.0992in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB12/3.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
    </draw:frame><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Picture 1" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="5.5811in" svg:height="3.1327in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB12/4.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
    </draw:frame><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oY3BrpoVbGI&amp;list=PLoDMmx9LIxpPcT2qrXQXAkda5pcvuWIdh" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link">Jésus calme la tempête – dans le langage Juni Kuin du Pérou</text:span></text:a></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"><text:line-break/>Les vidéos sont des fichiers MP4 qui peuvent être partagés avec d&apos;autres, téléchargés sur YouTube ou Vimeo, ou intégrés dans une application biblique.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:list xml:id="list205160434580350" text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum17">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:list>
      <text:list-item>
       <text:h text:style-name="P26" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc112848938"/>De quelles ressources ai-je besoin pour créer une vidéo de diaporama ?<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc112848938"/></text:h>
      </text:list-item>
     </text:list>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">Vous aurez besoin de :</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum14">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P29">Un projet d&apos;application Scripture App Builder <text:span text:style-name="T11">avec des fichiers audio et chronométrage</text:span>.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P28"><text:soft-page-break/>Un ensemble de modèles vidéo prédéfinis <text:span text:style-name="T11">diaporama</text:span>: nous vous montrerons comment les obtenir dans la section suivante. Ils contiennent toutes les images de la vidéo, ainsi que les instructions sur les parties de l&apos;Écriture à utiliser, où pan et zoomer et où se déplacer d&apos;un diapositive à l&apos;autre.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:list text:continue-list="list205160434580350" text:style-name="WWNum17">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:list>
      <text:list-item>
       <text:h text:style-name="P26" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc112848939"/>Quels modèles de diaporama sont actuellement disponibles ?<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc112848939"/></text:h>
      </text:list-item>
     </text:list>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">Les modèles vidéo disponibles sont :</text:p>
   <table:table table:name="Table1" table:style-name="Table1">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table1.A"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table1.B"/>
    <text:soft-page-break/>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P6">Matthieu</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P6">3 vidéos (histoires sélectionnées)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P6">Marquer</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P6">9 vidéos (histoires sélectionnées)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P6">Luc</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P6">6 vidéos (histoires sélectionnées)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P6">Jean</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P6">43 vidéos (livre complet)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P6">Actes</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P6">4 vidéos (histoires sélectionnées)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P6">Jonah</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P6">1 vidéo</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:list xml:id="list205159330976012" text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum17">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:h text:style-name="P23" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc112848940"/>Configuration des vidéos du diaporama<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc112848940"/> </text:h>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">Avant de créer votre première vidéo, vous devrez faire deux choses:</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum15">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P30">Téléchargez les modèles vidéo du diaporama.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P30">Installer LibreOffice.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:list xml:id="list205158815654368" text:continue-list="list205159330976012" text:style-name="WWNum17">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:list>
      <text:list-item>
       <text:h text:style-name="P27" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc112848941"/><text:soft-page-break/>Téléchargement des modèles vidéo du diaporama<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc112848941"/></text:h>
      </text:list-item>
     </text:list>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">Les modèles de vidéo contiennent des ensembles d&apos;images pour chaque vidéo, ainsi que des instructions sur les parties de l&apos;Écriture à utiliser, où pan et zoomer et où se déplacer d&apos;un diapositive à l&apos;autre. </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">Pour télécharger les modèles :</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum20">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P31"><text:span text:style-name="T4">dans le constructeur d&apos;applications bibliques, aller à </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12">Outils</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12">Paramètres </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12">Diaporamas</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T15"> <text:line-break/>(ou si vous utilisez un Mac, Constructeur d&apos;applications bibliques </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13">&lt;unk&gt;</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T15"> Préférences </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13">&lt;unk&gt;</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T15"> Diaporama)</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Picture 10" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="6.2681in" svg:height="4.5346in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB12/5.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
     <svg:desc>Interface utilisateur graphique, texte, application, email

Description générée automatiquement</svg:desc>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"><text:soft-page-break/></text:p>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum20">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P32">Cliquez sur <text:span text:style-name="T11">Télécharger les modèles…</text:span> bouton.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P7">Le processus d&apos;installation vous permettra de définir le dossier où les modèles seront situés sur votre ordinateur. Une fois installé, ce dossier apparaîtra dans les paramètres <text:span text:style-name="T11">des modèles Diaporamas </text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P8"><text:line-break/> </text:p>
   <text:list xml:id="list205158604908528" text:continue-list="list205158815654368" text:style-name="WWNum17">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:list>
      <text:list-item>
       <text:h text:style-name="P27" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc112848942"/>Installation de LibreOffice<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc112848942"/></text:h>
      </text:list-item>
     </text:list>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P9"><text:span text:style-name="T10">LibreOffice</text:span> sera utilisé pour créer les diapositives de titre dans chaque vidéo.</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum18">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P34"><text:soft-page-break/>Installez <text:span text:style-name="T10">LibreOffice</text:span> depuis <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://www.libreoffice.org/download/download-libreoffice/" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link">https://www.libreoffice.org/download</text:span></text:a></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P34" loext:marker-style-name="T4"><text:span text:style-name="T4">In Scripture App Builder, go to </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12">Tools</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T15"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12">Settings </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T15"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12">Slideshows </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T15">(or if using a Mac, </text:span>Scripture<text:span text:style-name="T15"> App Builder </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T15"> Preferences </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T15"> Slideshows).</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4"> </text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P33" loext:marker-style-name="T4"><text:span text:style-name="T4">Under </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12">LibreOffice Programs</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">, specify where the LibreOffice program is located on your computer.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19" loext:marker-style-name="T4"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19" loext:marker-style-name="T4"/>
   <text:list text:continue-list="list205158604908528" text:style-name="WWNum17">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:h text:style-name="P24" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc112848943"/>Préparation d&apos;un projet d&apos;application pour les vidéos de diaporama<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc112848943"/></text:h>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"><text:soft-page-break/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">Les vidéos contiendront des images qui pansent et zoomeront pendant que l&apos;audio est lu. Puisque l&apos;audio est extrait des fichiers audio et de chronométrage du projet, Il est important que <text:span text:style-name="T16">les fichiers de synchronisation soient précis</text:span> afin que les vidéos ne commencent pas ou ne se terminent pas au milieu d&apos;une phrase audio.<text:line-break/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Picture 8" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="5.7437in" svg:height="1.7465in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB12/6.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
     <svg:desc>Interface utilisateur graphique, application, table

Description générée automatiquement</svg:desc>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3"><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">Les transitions entre diapositives ne sont pas aussi critiques, mais la précision du timing est particulièrement importante au début et à la fin d&apos;une vidéo. Par exemple, si vous faites une vidéo sur la Visite des Mages (Matthieu 2, 1-23), vous devrez vous assurer que les timings sont précis pour le début du verset 1 et la fin du verset 23.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">Utilisez <text:span text:style-name="T11">Réglage fin des Timings</text:span> pour vérifier que les timings sont corrects.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"><text:soft-page-break/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:list xml:id="list205159468377056" text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum17">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:h text:style-name="P25" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc112848944"/>Exécuter l&apos;Assistant Créer un diaporama<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc112848944"/></text:h>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P9"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P10">Pour utiliser l&apos;assistant Créer un diaporama pour faire une vidéo :</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum19">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P36">Right-click on a book collection and select <text:span text:style-name="T11">Create Slideshow Videos…</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3"><draw:custom-shape text:anchor-type="char" draw:z-index="0" draw:name="Arrow: Left 15" draw:style-name="gr1" draw:text-style-name="P41" svg:width="0.7441in" svg:height="0.3378in" draw:transform="rotate (0.513650398861931) translate (4.93125in 1.90763888888889in)">
     <text:p/>
     <draw:enhanced-geometry draw:mirror-horizontal="false" draw:mirror-vertical="false" svg:viewBox="0 0 0 0" draw:glue-points="?f5 0 0 ?f7 ?f5 ?f14 ?f13 ?f7" draw:text-areas="?f12 ?f8 ?f13 ?f9" draw:type="ooxml-leftArrow" draw:modifiers="50000 50000" draw:enhanced-path="M 0 ?f7 L ?f5 0 ?f5 ?f8 ?f13 ?f8 ?f13 ?f9 ?f5 ?f9 ?f5 ?f14 Z N">
      <draw:equation draw:name="f0" draw:formula="min(logwidth,logheight)"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f1" draw:formula="100000*logwidth/?f0 "/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f2" draw:formula="if(0-$0 ,0,if(100000-$0 ,$0 ,100000))"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f3" draw:formula="if(0-$1 ,0,if(?f1 -$1 ,$1 ,?f1 ))"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f4" draw:formula="?f0 *?f3 /100000"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f5" draw:formula="0+?f4 -0"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f6" draw:formula="logheight*?f2 /200000"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f7" draw:formula="logheight/2"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f8" draw:formula="?f7 +0-?f6 "/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f9" draw:formula="?f7 +?f6 -0"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f10" draw:formula="logheight/2"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f11" draw:formula="?f8 *?f4 /?f10 "/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f12" draw:formula="?f5 +0-?f11 "/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f13" draw:formula="logwidth"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f14" draw:formula="logheight"/>
      <draw:handle draw:handle-range-y-maximum="100000" draw:handle-range-y-minimum="0" draw:handle-position="?f13 ?f8"/>
      <draw:handle draw:handle-range-x-maximum="?f1" draw:handle-range-x-minimum="0" draw:handle-position="?f5 0"/>
     </draw:enhanced-geometry>
    </draw:custom-shape><text:soft-page-break/><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Picture 12" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="4.0319in" svg:height="2.2299in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB12/7.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
     <svg:desc>Graphical user interface, text, application

Description automatically generated</svg:desc>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P7"/>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum19">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P37">Sélectionnez les vidéos dans la liste que vous voulez construire.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P7"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Picture 11" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="5.302in" svg:height="3.7382in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB12/8.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
     <svg:desc>Interface utilisateur graphique, application

Description générée automatiquement</svg:desc>
    </draw:frame><text:line-break/></text:p>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum19">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P35">Click <text:span text:style-name="T11">Next</text:span> and specify the <text:span text:style-name="T11">Titles Language</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="T11">Language Name</text:span> and <text:span text:style-name="T11">Country</text:span>.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="List_20_Paragraph"/>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum19">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P35"><text:soft-page-break/>Cliquez sur <text:span text:style-name="T11">A suivant</text:span> et spécifiez les informations <text:span text:style-name="T11">Code de langue</text:span>, texte et audio <text:span text:style-name="T11">Copyright </text:span>. </text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="List_20_Paragraph"><text:line-break/>The Text and Audio copyright information will be inserted automatically from the <text:span text:style-name="T11">Copyright &amp; Licensing</text:span> tab if it is already specified in the app project. Il peut être édité ici aussi. Ces informations seront incluses dans le titre de la vidéo et dans les diapositives finales de copyright.<text:line-break/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="List_20_Paragraph"/>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum19">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P35">Click <text:span text:style-name="T11">Next</text:span> and then the <text:span text:style-name="T11">Create Slideshows</text:span> button.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="List_20_Paragraph"><draw:custom-shape text:anchor-type="char" draw:z-index="1" draw:name="Arrow: Left 4" draw:style-name="gr1" draw:text-style-name="P41" svg:width="0.7441in" svg:height="0.3378in" draw:transform="rotate (0.513650398861931) translate (4.45138888888889in 3.13958333333333in)">
     <text:p/>
     <draw:enhanced-geometry draw:mirror-horizontal="false" draw:mirror-vertical="false" svg:viewBox="0 0 0 0" draw:glue-points="?f5 0 0 ?f7 ?f5 ?f14 ?f13 ?f7" draw:text-areas="?f12 ?f8 ?f13 ?f9" draw:type="ooxml-leftArrow" draw:modifiers="50000 50000" draw:enhanced-path="M 0 ?f7 L ?f5 0 ?f5 ?f8 ?f13 ?f8 ?f13 ?f9 ?f5 ?f9 ?f5 ?f14 Z N">
      <draw:equation draw:name="f0" draw:formula="min(logwidth,logheight)"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f1" draw:formula="100000*logwidth/?f0 "/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f2" draw:formula="if(0-$0 ,0,if(100000-$0 ,$0 ,100000))"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f3" draw:formula="if(0-$1 ,0,if(?f1 -$1 ,$1 ,?f1 ))"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f4" draw:formula="?f0 *?f3 /100000"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f5" draw:formula="0+?f4 -0"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f6" draw:formula="logheight*?f2 /200000"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f7" draw:formula="logheight/2"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f8" draw:formula="?f7 +0-?f6 "/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f9" draw:formula="?f7 +?f6 -0"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f10" draw:formula="logheight/2"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f11" draw:formula="?f8 *?f4 /?f10 "/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f12" draw:formula="?f5 +0-?f11 "/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f13" draw:formula="logwidth"/>
      <draw:equation draw:name="f14" draw:formula="logheight"/>
      <draw:handle draw:handle-range-y-maximum="100000" draw:handle-range-y-minimum="0" draw:handle-position="?f13 ?f8"/>
      <draw:handle draw:handle-range-x-maximum="?f1" draw:handle-range-x-minimum="0" draw:handle-position="?f5 0"/>
     </draw:enhanced-geometry>
    </draw:custom-shape><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Picture 3" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="5.1161in" svg:height="3.6071in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB12/9.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
     <svg:desc>Interface utilisateur graphique, application

Description générée automatiquement</svg:desc>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="List_20_Paragraph"><text:line-break/> <text:line-break/> </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="List_20_Paragraph"><text:soft-page-break/></text:p>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum19">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P35">Attendez pendant la compilation de la vidéo. Cela inclura l&apos;extraction de l&apos;audio, l&apos;ajout des images, l&apos;application du panoramique et des effets de zoom et la création des sous-titres. </text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">Lorsque les vidéos ont été créées, vous trouverez un sous-dossier correspondant à chaque vidéo. </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P11"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr2" draw:name="Image1" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="2.2291in" svg:height="1.2083in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB12/10.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
    </draw:frame><text:s/><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr2" draw:name="Image2" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="2.5626in" svg:height="1.052in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB12/11.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
    </draw:frame><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"><text:soft-page-break/><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P9">Each video subfolder will contain:</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum21">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P39">a <text:span text:style-name="T11">video file</text:span> (.mp4)</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P38">the corresponding <text:span text:style-name="T11">subtitle files</text:span> (.srt and .vtt). These can be used in video players such as <text:span text:style-name="T10">VLC</text:span> or for uploading to <text:span text:style-name="T10">YouTube</text:span> to make the text available as subtitles.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:list text:continue-list="list205159468377056" text:style-name="WWNum17">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:h text:style-name="P24" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc112848945"/><text:soft-page-break/>Distributing and using the videos<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc112848945"/></text:h>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">There are many ways of distributing your videos, such as:</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum22">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P40">Uploading them to a video sharing platform such as YouTube or Vimeo.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P40">Making them available on a language-specific website, or a site with multiple language resources such as Scripture Earth (<text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="http://www.ScriptureEarth.org/" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link">www.ScriptureEarth.org</text:span></text:a>)</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P40">Sharing them from phone to phone using Bluetooth or a Wi-Fi transfer app</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P40"><text:soft-page-break/>Sharing them on memory cards</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P40">Making them available on a Wi-Fi media hub</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">Once the videos are available in <text:span text:style-name="T10">YouTube</text:span> or another internet location, you can embed them in your apps. For more information on how to do this, please refer to the <text:span text:style-name="T11">Building Apps</text:span> manual, in the section titled <text:span text:style-name="T11">Video</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr2" draw:name="Image3" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="1.9957in" svg:height="3.4256in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB12/12.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
    </draw:frame><text:s/><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr2" draw:name="Image4" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="1.9965in" svg:height="3.4272in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB12/13.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
    </draw:frame><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"><text:line-break/><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="http://www.ScriptureEarth.org/" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link">www.ScriptureEarth.org</text:span></text:a> can host the video files for viewing or downloading. Please contact <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="mailto:info@ScriptureEarth.org" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link">info@ScriptureEarth.org</text:span></text:a> for more information.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P20" loext:marker-style-name="T17"><text:soft-page-break/><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P20" loext:marker-style-name="T17"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P9" loext:marker-style-name="T17"><text:span text:style-name="T17">Scripture Earth Example</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T17"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P9">Here is an example of what it looks like when a set of slideshow videos are uploaded to Scripture Earth:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P12"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://www.scriptureearth.org/00i-Scripture_Index.php?idx=22" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link">https://www.scriptureearth.org/00i-Scripture_Index.php?idx=22</text:span></text:a>. </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"><text:line-break/><text:line-break/>Click on <text:span text:style-name="T11">View Videos de las Escrituras</text:span> to view the list of videos. <text:line-break/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"><text:soft-page-break/><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Picture 6" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="6.2681in" svg:height="4.5429in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB12/14.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
    </draw:frame><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">If you click on a thumbnail image, you will be taken to YouTube to watch the video.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P9"><text:line-break/>Click <text:span text:style-name="T11">Download Videos de las Escrituras</text:span> to see the list of videos available to download. </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P9"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P13"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Picture 7" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="6.2681in" svg:height="2.5193in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB12/15.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
    </draw:frame><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P13"><text:soft-page-break/><text:line-break/>You can select several videos (or all of them) and download them as a zip file.</text:p>
  </office:text>
 </office:body>
</office:document>